Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:02.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bollywood is talking about a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:03.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Gujarati comedy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.19,0:00:06.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ruff & Tuff Kanya: a dad
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:08.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,who just won't let his daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.66,0:00:09.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.12,0:00:12.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scam 1992 director Hansal Mehta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:14.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,called it a must-watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,And said Gujarati cinema
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:19.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,deserves much more love from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.11,0:00:19.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,audiences.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.33,0:00:21.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,One honest note:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.49,0:00:23.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,no major critic reviews are out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.74,0:00:24.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:27.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seen it? Review it in one word
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.05,0:00:27.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,below.
